<h1 data-copy-en="Kurenai" data-copy-zh="Kurenai">Kurenai</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Skill lessons, facility access and personal conversation order." data-copy-zh="技能课程、设施访问与个人谈话顺序。">Skill lessons, facility access and personal conversation order.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">在哪里找到</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系节点</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">常见卡点</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Reading_the_Script"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Counterfeit_Love"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Kept_Partition"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Heart-to-Hearts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recommended_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Kurenai — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/kurenai.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Kurenai — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/kurenai.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Kurenai — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Kurenai offers three skill lessons, a separate hacked-access activity and a long personal conversation route. Use the named menu steps to navigate; the route’s explanations and conclusions stay in the game.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Hack_SECTS_Protocol_and_Private_Access"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Schedule_and_Daily_Affection"></span><h2>Where to find them</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Place</th><th scope="col">Portrait hours</th><th scope="col">Condition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Synthetic Companion Matching Facility</th><td data-label="Portrait hours">00:00–24:00</td><td data-label="Condition">—</td></tr></tbody></table></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Story_Choice_Rewards"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Introduction_and_Complete_Story_Route"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Follow the one-time personal actions in order, adding the three H2Hs when they appear. The stages rise from Known (25) through In Love (3000), and the H2Hs are required between later actions; affection alone does not skip them.</p><p>Private Access uses a separate facility hack. Learn System Hacking, then use the local Hack SECTS Protocol action: 30 minutes and 15 Energy, difficulty 25, with the AI Programming and Cybernetics bonuses. A successful hack opens the 60-minute, 40-Energy daily private action.</p><details><summary>Optional reference: personal and shared event navigation</summary><p>Each listed event happens once. Return to the named place after completing its prior steps. Completion affection is a base reward; dialogue choices can add further affection. The scenes and choice answers remain in the game.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Event</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base completion affection</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Welcome to Cyber-Sects</th><td data-label="Requirements">Synthetic Companion Matching Facility; 00:00–24:00</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Kurenai +3</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Skill_Lessons"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Service_Mask"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><details><summary>Action costs, requirements and rewards</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / usable start time</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / normal limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Kurenai</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Synthetic Companion Matching Facility</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+1 base affection; 3/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Jewelry</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Synthetic Companion Matching Facility; Acquaintance (50)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">10 min; 1 Jewelry</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+10 base affection; 3/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Private Access</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Synthetic Companion Matching Facility; Hack SECTS Protocol completed</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; −40 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+60 base affection; 1/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Reading the Script</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Synthetic Companion Matching Facility; Friend (100); Communication 50</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">30 min; keep 10 Energy and 5 Calm available; these resources are not consumed</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+8 direct affection; Communication +1; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Conversion Audit</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Synthetic Companion Matching Facility; Known (25); Welcome to Cyber-Sects</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">45 min; −10 Energy; −5 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Unpaid Attention</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Synthetic Companion Matching Facility; Acquaintance (50); Conversion Audit</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">45 min; −10 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Premium Profile</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Synthetic Companion Matching Facility; Friend (100); Unpaid Attention</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; −15 Energy; −5 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Service Mask</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Synthetic Companion Matching Facility; Friend (100); Premium Profile</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">75 min; −20 Energy; −10 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Retention Loop</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Synthetic Companion Matching Facility; Close Friend (200); Premium Profile; Service Mask</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; −15 Energy; −10 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Warranty Clause</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Synthetic Companion Matching Facility; Close Friend (200); Retention Loop</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; −10 Energy; −15 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Robot Bar Date</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Synthetic Companion Matching Facility; Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $100; −20 Energy; +10 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Skygarden Date</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Synthetic Companion Matching Facility; Close Friend (200); Retention Loop; 08:00–16:00</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $80; −30 Energy; +5 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Private Partition</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Synthetic Companion Matching Facility; Crush (400); Warranty Clause</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">75 min; −20 Energy; −10 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Kept Partition</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Synthetic Companion Matching Facility; Crush (400); Private Partition</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">90 min; −20 Energy; −15 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Unprofitable Refusal</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Synthetic Companion Matching Facility; Romantic (800); Private Partition; Kept Partition</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">75 min; −20 Energy; −20 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">First Unscripted Choice</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Synthetic Companion Matching Facility; Intimate (1600); Unprofitable Refusal</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">90 min; −25 Energy; −15 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Memory Arcade Date</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Synthetic Companion Matching Facility; Intimate (1600); First Unscripted Choice; 12:00–22:00</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $150; −35 Energy; −10 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Counterfeit Love</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Synthetic Companion Matching Facility; Intimate (1600); First Unscripted Choice</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">90 min; −20 Energy; +10 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Pattern Beneath</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Synthetic Companion Matching Facility; In Love (3000); First Unscripted Choice; Counterfeit Love</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">90 min; −25 Energy; −30 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Choose the Signal</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Synthetic Companion Matching Facility; In Love (3000); The Pattern Beneath</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; −30 Energy; −25 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Emotional Bonding</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Synthetic Companion Matching Facility; Acquaintance (50); Charm 16; full version</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">180 min; $250; −35 Energy; −25 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+10 base affection; Emotional Bonding; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Pleasure Arts</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Synthetic Companion Matching Facility; Friend (100); Ability 20; full version</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">200 min; $350; −50 Energy; −30 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+15 base affection; Pleasure Arts; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Intimate Communication</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Synthetic Companion Matching Facility; Friend (100); Charm 18; full version</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">180 min; $350; −40 Energy; −30 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+15 base affection; Intimate Communication; once</td></tr></tbody></table></details><p>The three lessons have their own stats, money and resource costs; they are not automatic rewards for finishing the personal route. See the action table for every lesson and conversation cost.</p><details><summary>Optional reference: affection bonuses</summary><p>Each favorite-stat threshold adds 1 to ordinary base affection before other bonuses; the favorite skill doubles the adjusted base. Direct rewards remain the listed direct amount.</p><p>Charm 85; Technology 85; Stamina 90</p><p>Favorite skill: Seduction</p></details><p>Start windows exclude their ending hour. Costs are base values; applicable skills and active bonuses may change them. Base affection, direct affection and NPC intimacy experience are distinct. Dialogue choices can add rewards beyond the listed event-completion base.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Troubleshooting"></span><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>A missing later conversation usually means its prior action or H2H is unfinished.</li><li>A completed facility hack opens Private Access; the normal personal route has separate affection and conversation checks.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="skills.html">System Hacking and lessons</a></li><li><a href="locations.html">Location reference</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-story-beats.html">Story navigation</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Reading_the_Script"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Counterfeit_Love"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Kept_Partition"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Heart-to-Hearts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recommended_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Kurenai 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/kurenai.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Kurenai 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/kurenai.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Kurenai 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Kurenai 提供三项技能课程、独立的破解访问行动，以及较长的个人谈话路线。可依菜单步骤推进；剧情解释与结局请在游戏中体验。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Hack_SECTS_Protocol_and_Private_Access"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Schedule_and_Daily_Affection"></span><h2>在哪里找到</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">肖像在场时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">合成伴侣匹配设施</th><td data-label="肖像在场时段">00:00–24:00</td><td data-label="条件">—</td></tr></tbody></table></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Story_Choice_Rewards"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Introduction_and_Complete_Story_Route"></span><h2>路线与关系节点</h2><p>一次性个人行动需依次完成，并穿插出现的三段谈心。关系门槛从已知（25）逐步升至恋爱中（3000）；后期行动之间还要求指定谈心，单纯增加好感度无法跳过。</p><p>私人访问使用独立的设施破解条件。先学会系统黑客，再使用地点菜单的 SECTS 协议破解行动：耗时 30 分钟、消耗 15 精力，难度 25，AI编程与控制论技能可提供加成。破解成功后开放每天一次、60 分钟及 40 精力的私人行动。</p><details><summary>可选查阅：个人与共同事件的触发条件</summary><p>下列事件均为一次性内容。完成前置后，请返回对应地点。完成好感度列为基础奖励，对话选择还可能追加好感度。剧情与选项答案请在游戏中体验。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">事件</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">完成基础好感度</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">欢迎来到赛博性区</th><td data-label="条件">合成伴侣匹配设施; 00:00–24:00</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Kurenai +3</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Skill_Lessons"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Service_Mask"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><details><summary>行动消耗、条件与奖励</summary><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／可开始时间</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／常规次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">与 Kurenai 交谈</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">合成伴侣匹配设施</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">15 分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+1 基础好感度; 3次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送珠宝</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">合成伴侣匹配设施; 相识 (50)</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">10 分钟; 1 珠宝</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+10 基础好感度; 3次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">私密访问</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">合成伴侣匹配设施; 入侵性区协定已成功完成</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60 分钟; −40 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+60 基础好感度; 1次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">读懂脚本</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">合成伴侣匹配设施; 朋友 (100); 沟通 50</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">30 分钟；基础可用量要求 10 精力、5 镇定，这两项不会扣除</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+8 直接好感度; 沟通 +1; 一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">转化审计</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">合成伴侣匹配设施; 已知 (25); 欢迎来到赛博性区</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">45 分钟; −10 精力; −5 镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">未付费的关注</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">合成伴侣匹配设施; 相识 (50); 转化审计</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">45 分钟; −10 精力</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">高级档案</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">合成伴侣匹配设施; 朋友 (100); 未付费的关注</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60 分钟; −15 精力; −5 镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">服务面具</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">合成伴侣匹配设施; 朋友 (100); 高级档案</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">75 分钟; −20 精力; −10 镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">留存循环</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">合成伴侣匹配设施; 亲密朋友 (200); 高级档案; 服务面具</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60 分钟; −15 精力; −10 镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">保修条款</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">合成伴侣匹配设施; 亲密朋友 (200); 留存循环</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60 分钟; −10 精力; −15 镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">机器人酒吧约会</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">合成伴侣匹配设施; 朋友 (100)</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120 分钟; $100; −20 精力; +10 镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">空中花园约会</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">合成伴侣匹配设施; 亲密朋友 (200); 留存循环; 08:00–16:00</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120 分钟; $80; −30 精力; +5 镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">私有分区</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">合成伴侣匹配设施; 迷恋 (400); 保修条款</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">75 分钟; −20 精力; −10 镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">保留下来的分区</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">合成伴侣匹配设施; 迷恋 (400); 私有分区</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">90 分钟; −20 精力; −15 镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">无利可图的拒绝</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">合成伴侣匹配设施; 浪漫感 (800); 私有分区; 保留下来的分区</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">75 分钟; −20 精力; −20 镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">第一个即兴选择</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">合成伴侣匹配设施; 亲密 (1600); 无利可图的拒绝</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">90 分钟; −25 精力; −15 镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">记忆游戏厅约会</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">合成伴侣匹配设施; 亲密 (1600); 第一个即兴选择; 12:00–22:00</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120 分钟; $150; −35 精力; −10 镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">假爱</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">合成伴侣匹配设施; 亲密 (1600); 第一个即兴选择</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">90 分钟; −20 精力; +10 镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">潜藏的模式</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">合成伴侣匹配设施; 恋爱中 (3000); 第一个即兴选择; 假爱</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">90 分钟; −25 精力; −30 镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">选择信号</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">合成伴侣匹配设施; 恋爱中 (3000); 潜藏的模式</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120 分钟; −30 精力; −25 镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">情感联结</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">合成伴侣匹配设施; 相识 (50); 魅力 16; 完整版</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">180 分钟; $250; −35 精力; −25 镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+10 基础好感度; 情感联结; 一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">愉悦技巧</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">合成伴侣匹配设施; 朋友 (100); 能力 20; 完整版</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">200 分钟; $350; −50 精力; −30 镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+15 基础好感度; 愉悦技巧; 一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">亲密沟通</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">合成伴侣匹配设施; 朋友 (100); 魅力 18; 完整版</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">180 分钟; $350; −40 精力; −30 镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+15 基础好感度; 亲密沟通; 一次性</td></tr></tbody></table></details><p>三项课程各有属性、金钱与资源消耗，不会因完成个人路线而自动获得。各课程及谈话的消耗都列在行动表中。</p><details><summary>可选查阅：好感度加成</summary><p>每达到一项偏好属性门槛，普通好感度计算的基础值增加 1；偏好技能会将调整后的基础值翻倍。直接奖励仍按标明的直接数值加入。</p><p>魅力 85; 科技 85; 耐力 90</p><p>偏好技能：诱惑</p></details><p>开始时段不包含结束整点。消耗为基础值，适用技能与当前加成可能改变实际数值。基础好感度、直接好感度与 NPC 亲密经验分别计算；对话选择还可能在事件完成基础奖励之外追加奖励。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Troubleshooting"></span><h2>常见卡点</h2><ul><li>后续谈话未出现时，通常是前一项行动或谈心尚未完成。</li><li>设施破解完成后开放私人访问；普通个人路线则使用自己的好感度与谈话前置。</li></ul></section>
